    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rlim](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rlim) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 106.998 depth occurred on Nov 04 2025 74km S of Suwawa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -0.1355 longitude 123.1307. It impacted 2372 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
